        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Menyirok ma cawilin aŋwen",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awire t'atiŋo waŋan malo, aŋiyo, aka neni, cawilin aŋwen jowok i dier gote ario, aka gote me oyido obedo ma ywel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.4"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 6:4",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 6:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cawila marapena oyido nitie gi kayinin m'obokere, aka mar'ario oyido nitie gi kayinin macol. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.6.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 6:2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cawila mar'adek oyido nitie gi kayinin matar, aka cawila mar'aŋwen oyido nitie gi kayinin makicin manyakwoyokwoyo, ma jotek. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apenjo malaika m'oyido luwo kodan ni, “Me ginaŋo rwoth?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.7.1"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Meny 7:1",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Malaika odwoko to waco ran ni, “Me koyin aŋwen ma polo, ma jowok nyaka ruwaŋ Rwoth ma piny gibe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cawila manitie gi kayinin macol kadho i piny ma yumalo, aka manitie gi kayinin matar oluwo jo; cawila manitie gi kayinin makicin manyakwoyokwoyo okadho i piny ma yupiny.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kayinin matek jowok, aka jodwaro kadho woth thoko piny. Malaika owaco ni, “Kadhi wiwoth thoko piny.” To jowotho thoko piny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo go oywakere ran ka waco ni, “Neni, jono ma jokadho i piny ma yumalo jomiyo Cunyan kwe i piny ma yumalo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Or ma ruko ri Yosuwa sangaria",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wac pa Rwoth obino ran ka waco ni, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kwany mic wok kwoŋ jotwec, Heldai, Tobia, kodi Yedaya, ma jotieko tundo wok i Babilon, aka ikadhi i ndelo no won, i ot pa Yosia wod Zefania. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwany bongi jo feza gi zahabu, itimi sangaria aka ikethi i wi Yosuwa, wod Yehozadak jadwoŋ pa jocway ri Were i wi migam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.23.5"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Yer 23:5",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "JER.33.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "33:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "ZEC.3.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Zek 3:8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iwaci rigo ni, Rwoth pa lwak jolweny waco ni, ‘Neni, jal ma nyinge obedo Jangi yath; kole go ladongo i kabedo pere to geto Ot pa Rwoth.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Go ama lageto Ot pa Rwoth, go latiŋo dwoŋ, go labedo to dhumo i kom ma dhum pere, go labedo jacway ri Were i wi migam i kom ma dhum pere, aka rieko ma siem labedo i dier j'ario. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Sangarin labedo paka rapoy i Ot pa Rwoth ri Heldai, Tobia, Yedaya, kodi Yosia wod Zefania.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ji ma jonitie bor jolabino geto Ot pa Rwoth, aka wilaŋeyo nike Rwoth pa lwak jolweny ooran bongi win. Gime latundo i kare, ka winowinji gi gwokirok, dwondi Rwoth Were mewin.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
